{
  "an4.87:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.87 ",
  "an4.87:0.2": "9. Macalavagga ",
  "an4.87:0.3": "Puttasutta ",
  "an4.87:1.1": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "an4.87:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.87:1.3": "Samaṇamacalo, samaṇapuṇḍarīko, samaṇapadumo, samaṇesu samaṇasukhumālo. ",
  "an4.87:2.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo samaṇamacalo hoti? ",
  "an4.87:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sekho hoti pāṭipado; ",
  "an4.87:2.3": "anuttaraṁ yogakkhemaṁ patthayamāno viharati. ",
  "an4.87:2.4": "Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, rañño khattiyassa muddhāvasittassa jeṭṭho putto ābhiseko anabhisitto macalappatto; ",
  "an4.87:2.5": "evamevaṁ kho, bhikkhave, bhikkhu sekho hoti pāṭipado, anuttaraṁ yogakkhemaṁ patthayamāno viharati. ",
  "an4.87:2.6": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, puggalo samaṇamacalo hoti. ",
  "an4.87:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo samaṇapuṇḍarīko hoti? ",
  "an4.87:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu āsavānaṁ khayā anāsavaṁ cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ diṭṭheva dhamme sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja viharati, no ca kho aṭṭha vimokkhe kāyena phusitvā viharati. ",
  "an4.87:3.3": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, puggalo samaṇapuṇḍarīko hoti. ",
  "an4.87:4.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo samaṇapadumo hoti? ",
  "an4.87:4.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu āsavānaṁ khayā anāsavaṁ cetovimuttiṁ paññāvimuttiṁ diṭṭheva dhamme sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā upasampajja